    <p class="card-kicker">01 · Traceability</p>
    <h2>Documents are the interface</h2>
    <p>Important decisions live in feature specs, change plans, and decision records instead of disappearing into chat history.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="signal-card">
    <p class="card-kicker">02 · Boundaries</p>
    <h2>Roles define authority</h2>
    <p>Agents know what they may change, what they must produce, and when a human decision is required.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="signal-card">
    <p class="card-kicker">03 · Gates</p>
